# T105 (story 2): install app-04 from the list: the plan in plain sentences first, the installer's text behind Show details, the two consents the
# reader still asks for, Confirm, the result. The result says where it appears and that a restart may be needed.
# scenario demo
# expect-file applications/app-04.bin
# expect-file applications/app-04.app
# expect-file system/pbstore/installed/app-04.json
size 1404 1872
wait 400
tap refresh
waitfor catalogLine Catalog last updated
tap appRow 3
waitfor detailState Not installed
tap actionInstall
waitfor planSummary Install App app-04 1.2.0
expect_disabled confirm
shot @OUT@/20-plan.png
expect_absent planText
tap toggleDetails
waitfor planText Plan: Install App app-04
expect planText applications/app-04.bin
expect planText @General
shot @OUT@/21-plan-details.png
tap toggleDetails
expect_absent planText
tap consent 0
expect_disabled confirm
tap consent 1
expect_enabled confirm
tap confirm
waitfor resultText
expect resultText App app-04 is installed
expect resultText appear in @General
expect resultText restart the reader
shot @OUT@/22-result.png
tap ok
waitfor appRow
expect rowState Installed
quit
